), between them accounting for over 90% of total data deposited to date. Notably rapid data growth in recent years has been in imaging data resources - BioImage Archive (BIA) (
9
); and the electron microscopy imaging resources Electron Microscopy Public Image Archive (EMPIAR) (
10
) and Electron Microscopy Databank (EMDB) (
